  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: quadratic parse time in the tarfile module when a\n     streaming archive declares an offset past the end of the stream\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-11972.patch: stop the forward-seek loop in\n       _Stream.seek() as soon as read() returns no data, in Lib/tarfile.py,\n       so a crafted mode=\"r|\" archive can no longer keep the parser reading\n       an exhausted stream.\n     - CVE-2026-11972",
